 **Parameters:**
-*   **DCT Order:** Fixed ordering of retained coefficients [S1].
-*   **Quantization Steps:** Same as intra coding [S1].
+*   **Block Size:** Not specified in the sources, but implied to be a fixed 3D block size suitable for 3D DCT [S1].
